{"id":"454326","name":"墨鱼水鸭汤","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/454326/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"水鸭子","amount":"一只"},{"name":"墨鱼","amount":"两只"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适合"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好墨鱼，提前泡发。","img":"images/454326/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"新鲜的水鸭子剁块，洗干净。","img":"images/454326/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅烧水，加姜片和葱，下水鸭子焯水。","img":"images/454326/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸭子过凉水洗干净，泡好的墨鱼洗干净盐份切大一点的片。","img":"images/454326/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"电高压锅加水，放墨鱼。","img":"images/454326/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放鸭子入锅内，加姜片。","img":"images/454326/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盖好锅盖，压40分钟，好了。","img":"images/454326/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加盐，鸡精调味，起锅。","img":"images/454326/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加葱节，开吃。","img":"images/454326/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}